WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.089
It feels like Christmas when we get cold and frosty.

2
00:00:07.090 --> 00:00:15.911
It seems like Christmas when we mail our holiday cards.

3
00:00:15.912 --> 00:00:23.110
It sparkles like Christmas when we light the tree.

4
00:00:23.111 --> 00:00:29.135
It tastes like Christmas when we lick candy canes.

5
00:00:29.136 --> 00:00:34.960
It smells like Christmas when we bake cookies.

6
00:00:34.961 --> 00:00:40.923
It looks like Christmas when we hang our stockings.

7
00:00:40.924 --> 00:00:50.407
It sounds like Christmas when we sing carols.

8
00:00:50.408 --> 00:00:56.924
When we open our presents, it is Christmas!

